{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23162","headline":"钱侍郎使君以题庐山草堂诗见寄因酬之 · 白居易","name":"钱侍郎使君以题庐山草堂诗见寄因酬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷勤江郡守，怅望掖垣郎。\n慙见新琼什，思归旧草堂。\n事随心未得，名与道相妨。\n若不休官去，人间到老忙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}